WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.900
How to store Christmas decorations, so you can find them next year.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:12.500
One. Check the lights first. Cracked sockets or bare wires? Throw that set out.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:18.200
Two. Wind each string on cardboard, and write where it goes.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:23.500
Three. Ornaments in dividers. Heaviest on the bottom.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:29.400
Four. Number every bin, and take one photo of what's inside.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.500
Five. Say where it's kept.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.600
The Packed Rabbit. Just ask the rabbit.
